| dev3 | v3 (τ = ∞) | 0.035 | 0.792 |
| dev3 | settled law, τ = 0 | 0.017 | 0.900 |
| dev3 | settled law, τ = 1000 / 3000 / 6000 / 12000 | 0.018 / 0.019 / 0.020 / 0.024 | 0.896 / 0.888 / 0.877 / 0.857 |
| dev2 | v3, and the settled law at any τ | 0.008 | 0.970 |

**The transient is not yet modelled.** For c/s < thr, the time from the first crossing to the last step above thr
